[-] paraphrase		<-->	verb++	[241116][001]	./ˈpærəfreɪz/-NAmE /ˈpærəfreɪz/
[transitive, intransitive] [br]
	;diễn giải lại -- (1) paraphrase (something) to express what somebody has said or written using different words, especially in order to make it easier to understand
		;Try to paraphrase the question before you answer it.
		;Word Origin
	;;








[-] paraphrase		<-->	n++	[241116][001]	./ˈpærəfreɪz/-NAmE /ˈpærəfreɪz/ [br]
	;sự diễn giải lại -- (1) a statement that expresses something that somebody has written or said using different words, especially in order to make it easier to understand
		;Word Origin
